Z||000011||Fformula88||01-04-2001||06:38 PM||||I have ordered a ton of stuff from them!  On some of the parts they are a little high, but not too bad.  Their genuine GM parts seem competitive to me.  Plus their service is top notch!  I'd rather do business witrh them than carparts or a number of the other mail order places.  They also get stuff to me in 1 or 2 days!  That Canadian border has a way of stalling delivery trucks for days!  <P>A while back I ordered a Fiero decklid sticker from them (along with a bunch of other stuff).  When it arrived it was the block style letters from the earlier years, but I was using it on an 87 which has the split letters.  I called them up and the immediately sent me a new one free of charge, and told me to keep the other one too!  What service!  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
Z||000012||88formula||01-04-2001||07:22 PM||||I have ordered a ton of stuff from them and I have been very happy with there service. I get the merchandise within 2-3 days and there is never anything missing.<P>I can get allot of stuff cheaper from other places but I choose to order from them because of there reputation and service.<P>||||reg||1
